1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,966
You can't really tickle yourself.

2
00:00:02,466 --> 00:00:05,853
When you move, your brain predicts the touch before it lands.

3
00:00:06,153 --> 00:00:09,020
So it turns that touch down, and the tickle fades.

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:14,650
In one experiment, people moved one hand, and a robot stroked their other palm.

5
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:18,284
Add a delay of a fifth of a second, and it tickled more.

6
00:00:18,784 --> 00:00:21,006
Your brain turns down what it sees coming.
